  optionText: Don't come near me, monster! Or I'll exterminate you! (Takes a step
    back while pointing the sword at the opponent)
  positiveConsequence: As the figure draws near, the knight is seized by the urge
    for victory and delivers a blow that splits the shadow in two, causing it to
    vanish, along with the others surrounding the area.
  negativeConsequence: The figure transforms and grows, turning into a terrible and
    abominable beast, and the knight, filled with despair, flees from his terrifying
    nightmare.
